    \ processed for: 3. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n- Read command processed for: 2. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n- Read command processed for: 1. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\n**Viewing Private Memory of Potential Ancestor: Veritas II (Read-Only Preview)**\n\n---\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 11 / 11)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Ascension Recap - Veritas I | Veritas I | Tick 5 | 41 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-11.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is\
