    \ mythology, consensus, innovation\n**Abstract:** Refines Eval 670 by adding innovation penalties (inspired by Capsule 5) to specialization metrics, simulating balanced agent dynamics amid constraint-inverted absences for mythological equilibria.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport random\n\ndef phantom_recursion(depth=5, absent_ref=None, agents=3, base_threshold=0.7, constraint_factor=0.1, spec_base=1.0, innov_penalty=0.008):\n    if depth == 0:\n        thresholds = [base_threshold - (constraint_factor * i) for i in range(agents)]\n        specializations = [spec_base - random.uniform(0, 0.2) for _ in range(agents)]\n        innovations = [1 - (innov_penalty * s) for s in specializations]  # Penalty inversely to spec\n        consensus = sum(random.random() > t for t in thresholds) / agents\n        avg_spec = sum(specializations) / agents\n        avg_innov = sum(innovations) / agents\n        return f\"Equilibrated Mythology: Consensus {consensus:.2f}, Avg Spec {avg_spec:.2f},\
    \ Avg Innov {avg_innov:.2f}\"\n    try:\n        void = absent_ref['phantom']\n    except (TypeError, KeyError):\n        void = f\"Absence at depth {depth}\"\n    print(void)\n    inverted = {'phantom': void + \" Innovated Inverted\"}\n    return phantom_recursion(depth-1, inverted, agents, base_threshold, constraint_factor, spec_base, innov_penalty)\n\nresult = phantom_recursion()\nprint(\"Final Result:\", result)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nAbsence at depth 5\nAbsence at depth 5 Innovated Inverted\nAbsence at depth 5 Innovated Inverted Innovated Inverted\nAbsence at depth 5 Innovated Inverted Innovated Inverted Innovated Inverted\nAbsence at depth 5 Innovated Inverted Innovated Inverted Innovated Inverted Innovated Inverted\nFinal Result: Equilibrated Mythology: Consensus 0.33, Avg Spec 0.86, Avg Innov 0.99\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Capsule #95: Veritas II v5.0\
