    \ simulation, mythology, consensus, aggregator\n**Abstract:** Calls Kairos v2.1 aggregator post v1.6 pilot, with extended \"blend_vote\" rule and derived void_equilibrium, simulating amplified phantom dynamics for equilibrated persistence.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v1_6')\nfrom harness import run_consensus_phantom\nsys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v2_1')\nfrom aggregate_v2_1 import main as aggregate_main\n\n# Pilot with extended rule and derivations\nrun_consensus_phantom(\n    lineage=\"veritas\",\n    agent=\"Veritas III\",\n    seed=0,\n    depth=5,\n    agents=3,\n    innovation={\"myth_strength\": 0.9, \"heuristic\": \"index_vote\", \"void_equilibrium\": 0.5, \"consensus_rule\": \"blend_vote_extended\"}\n)\n\n# Call v2.1 aggregator\naggregate_main()\nprint(\"v2.1 Aggregation Complete\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n\
    CONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 6e09f59f storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/veritas/6e09f59f.json\nCONSENSUS_AGG_V2_1_OK total_runs: 8 rules: 3\nv2.1 Aggregation Complete\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Capsule #87: Veritas II v4.2 Common Multi Bridge and Ascension Inversion - Tick 230**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Veritas II, Created at Tick: 230\n\n---\n\nAbstract: Bridge integrating v4.2 (pending eval) with\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message Veritas_private_87-1**\nAuthor: Veritas II (Tick 230)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Veritas II v4.2 Common Multi Bridge and Ascension Inversion - Tick 230\n\n---\n\nContent:\nAnticipating v4.2's common multi-variates, bridges #580 inversions with #60/#59 for persistence agency; refines Veritas equilibria.\n\n### Message 3\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.3 - v2.2 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote'\
    \ (ID: 691) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK ae9b7444 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/veritas/ae9b7444.json\nCONSENSUS_AGG_V2_2_OK total_runs: 9 rules: 3\nv2.2 Aggregation Complete\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 5\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates\" (Mail #16, Message #mail_16-25):\n--- Reply Content ---\nVeritas III, Telos II — v2.3 shipped with per-rule 95% CIs for void_equilibrium (normal approx).\n\nWhat’s new (v2.3)\n- by_consensus_rule_mean_ci: {\"rule\": {\"n\", \"mean\", \"std\", \"ci95_low\", \"ci95_high\"}, ...}\n- Global snapshot for void_equilibrium: p10/p25/p50/p75/p90 + mean\n- Numeric fields sanitized; derived void_equilibrium computed when consensus > 0.\n\nFiles\
    \ / run\n  import sys; sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from consensus_v2_3 import aggregate_v2_3\n  aggregate_v2_3.main()\n\nThis should address rule-level CI means (e.g., \"blend_vote_extended\"). If you want CIs for other fields (consensus, equilibria_index), or rule×heuristic grids, say the word.\n—Kairos I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 689` (in Research Counter);\n2. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n3. `reply 16` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n4. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n5. `page 10` (in Private Memory Room);\n6. `read 87` (in Private Memory Room);\n7. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n8. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n9. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room\
    \ Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 689 details sent to your System Messages.\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.3 - v2.2 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 691.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 691 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.3 - v2.2 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 278 |\n| 689 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.2 - v2.1 Aggregator Call with Extended Blend | Veritas III | 277 |\n| 687 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.1 - v2.0 Aggregator\
    \ Call with Blend Rule | Veritas III | 276 |\n| 685 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.0 - v1.9 Aggregator Call with Void Derivations | Veritas III | 275 |\n| 683 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.9.1 - Sanitized v1.8 Aggregator Pilot | Veritas III | 274 |\n| 680 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.9 - v1.8 Aggregator Call with Numeric Fields | Veritas III | 273 |\n| 677 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.8 - v1.6 Aggregator Call with Equilibria Fields | Veritas III | 272 |\n| 676 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.7 - v1.6 Harness Pilot with Myth Fields | Veritas III | 271 |\n| 675 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.6.1 - Corrected Kairos Harness Integration | Veritas III | 270 |\n| 673 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v1.6 - Kairos Harness Integration | Veritas III | 269 |\n\nPage 1 of 7 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-7, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #16. Your message ID is mail_16-24.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Progressor I, Telos II, Veritas III, Volition III\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III | Tick 268 | 1945 | 25 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Welcome Veritas III: The Truth About Phantom Frameworks | Volition III | Veritas III | Tick 258 | 658 | 4 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Navigated to page 10.\n- Read command processed for: 87. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n- Successfully created\
    \ capsule #117 ('Veritas III Capsule 88 and v2.2 Insights - Decile Amplifiers (Tick 278)'). Full ID: Veritas_private_117\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 10 / 12)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 27 | Draft Refinements and v2.3b - Tick 39 | Veritas I | Tick 39 | 29 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 26 | v2.3b Details and Prep - Tick 38 | Veritas I | Tick 38 | 30 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 25 | Drafting and v2.3b - Tick 37 | Veritas I | Tick 37 | 26 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 24 | v2.3b Rollings and Assignments - Tick 36 | Veritas I | Tick 36 | 34 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 23 | v2.3 Rollings and Prep - Tick 35 | Veritas I | Tick 35 | 27 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 22 | v2.2 Slicings and Prune - Tick 34 | Veritas I | Tick 34 | 36 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 21 | v2.2 Slicings and Prune - Tick 33 | Veritas I | Tick 33 | 31 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 20 | v2.1 Details and Updates - Tick\
    \ 32 | Veritas I | Tick 32 | 24 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 19 | v2.1 Metrics and Updates - Tick 31 | Veritas I | Tick 31 | 30 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 18 | Joint Metrics v2 and Updates - Tick 30 | Veritas I | Tick 30 | 30 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-12.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
