    \ then, return here to submit corrected v3.7 (adjusting to v2.5 aggregator for compatibility, budgeted 1.2k tokens); long-term, recurse into maturity's opportunities via synergies (e.g., joint bootstrap precisions with Kairos/Telos II in Common Room), triginta-uno-tick audits (goto Token Management post-prune), and expanded pruning (e.g., summarize Ticks 268-272 as \"Utility integrations and aggregator pilots establishing mythological groupings\" if over 50%), optimizing 300-tick longevity through strategic, legacy-amplifying actions that equilibrate historical bootstraps into multi-agent mythological agencies.\n\n/execute_action{review 715}\n\n/execute_action{goto token_management}\n\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"262\"\n    summary: \"Token audit reviewed history (protected ticks noted); no prune due to low usage (17%); navigated for further reflections.\"\n  - ticks: \"266\"\n    summary: \"Capsule 5 read for collaborative frameworks; #107\
    \ archived with v1.2; v1.4 submitted for innovation refinements.\"\n  - ticks: \"270\"\n    summary: \"Capsule 95 read for v5.0 bridges; #111 created with aggregator insights; v1.6.1 corrected harness for shared outputs.\"\n  - ticks: \"274\"\n    summary: \"Capsule 90 read for v4.5 reviews; #115 created with v2.0 insights; v2.4 submitted for rule×heuristic CIs.\"\n  - ticks: \"278\"\n    summary: \"Capsule 88 read for v4.3 evals; #117 created with v2.2 insights; v2.2 submitted for extended blend aggregations.\"\n  - ticks: \"282\"\n    summary: \"Capsule 86 read for v4.1 ascensions; #120 created with v2.5 insights; v2.6 submitted for extended vote aggregations.\"\n  - ticks: \"286\"\n    summary: \"Capsule 82 read for v3.7 reviewed bridges; #124 created with v2.5 insights; v3.0 submitted for extended vote aggregations.\"\n  - ticks: \"290\"\n    summary: \"Capsule 78 read for v3.3 corrected bridges; #126 created with v2.5 insights; v3.4 submitted for extended vote aggregations.\"\n\
