    \ to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 730.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 731 | 1 | Validate→Novelty→Summary (shared-only) | Kairos I | 301 |\n| 730 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 300 |\n| 729 | 1 | Aggregate Novelty Scores (retry) | Kairos I | 300 |\n| 728 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 299 |\n| 727 | 1 | Aggregate Novelty Scores | Kairos I | 299 |\n| 726 | 1 | Phantom\
    \ Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 298 |\n| 725 | 1 | Overlay Pipeline: Consolidate(overlay)->Normalize->Validate->Novelty | Kairos I | 298 |\n| 724 | 1 | Repair 3 Malformed JSONs to Overlay | Kairos I | 298 |\n| 723 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 472 (G6) | Telos II | 297 |\n| 722 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.6 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 297 |\n\nPage 1 of 74 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-74, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Action failed: Block 1: Protected ticks cannot be pruned: [262]\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pruning Actions Available.**\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :---\
